    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0000",
      "source_sha256": "dd3d81023bfd7bc6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "Where is the sick man, so that we may send him to you? Or is he with you yourselves, so that you will send him to us?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0001",
      "source_sha256": "f5a457a1856d5e7c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "Especially because of our role as guides—or if you do not call me “father” with your tongue alone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0002",
      "source_sha256": "3c4c271cd6149f1d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "What does it matter if I give it to someone in front of you with my own hands, or indeed in front of"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0003",
      "source_sha256": "2106cd4cfcb30361",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 4,
      "text": "It is not right for me to snatch it from other people's hands to avoid giving it to them. Or if I encourage you to drink wine, I do not want us to grow bold and dare to perform acts of martyrdom."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0004",
      "source_sha256": "574fabbf615730cd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Or is this not the work of all the saints? Or is it not suffering and hardship that is written about in the Scriptures?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0005",
      "source_sha256": "60be0d285bf1720a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Is there any rest? Or is there none, again, that does not [?] him until he dies?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0006",
      "source_sha256": "568e972c1ac392d7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "But, apart from the rules laid down for us, I want no one among us to grumble or find fault, and I want his good deed to be done not under compulsion but willingly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0007",
      "source_sha256": "b8d83d9b29a9f3d9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "Therefore, tell me clearly in your letters, all of you together, without hypocrisy, why you have adopted that rule among yourselves, so that I may understand what benefit it has before God and before people."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0008",
      "source_sha256": "22a8c9b7c6467ce7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 4,
      "text": "And at your six evening prayer times, say your prayers only in your house. Do not work until I have time to investigate this matter."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "f4e80b956d631263",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "and other matters like these as well, for I am determined not to let anyone find anything to say against me on any pretext on the day of judgment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0010",
      "source_sha256": "dd42c323f6cf38fe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "And in the morning, too, say your prayers properly, and also do your other little manual tasks according to your rules."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0011",
      "source_sha256": "7d42b3bcc08e3b9a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Do not delay excessively, lest you do these things while you are agitated."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0012",
      "source_sha256": "b80c6e0a2a90284e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Do not start before the proper time either."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0013",
      "source_sha256": "da7d3c8d1b53ad55",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "I have said many times that the midst of old men, old women, children, and those among you who are weaker is not the place for a person to display his strength."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0014",
      "source_sha256": "08b58b4af4bbc4d5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 10,
      "text": "Rather, at a time of unceasing prayer, or extensive meditation, or nights of keeping watch with strength, he reveals himself before the wise."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0015",
      "source_sha256": "fab5aa07425780d7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 4,
      "text": "And whoever wants to practice self-control by enduring greater hardship—who does not rejoice with him, in heaven and on earth among all the people who desire the glory of God and the honor of his holy places?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0016",
      "source_sha256": "90e44c0221435fb4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 4,
      "text": "Only do not neglect to tell me, for the fear of God is always before me because of you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0017",
      "source_sha256": "e92413f4a4227197",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "I beg you to take care of one another in every appropriate way and give relief to my heart."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/shenoute_place#CopScr.shenoute-place.000.0018",
      "source_sha256": "915ba9f76f011fd2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-14",
      "group_size": 9,
      "text": "Farewell, and pray for me."
    }
  ]
}
